1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Bukele just made the worst mistake of his life: falling into a black hole.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Everything seems like a space nightmare. Stars deform, light curves, space distorts.

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Not a vacuum cleaner. Gravity curves space-time itself.

4
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:29,000
He crosses the event horizon. The point of no return.

5
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:38,000
If it's big enough, he could cross without noticing anything.

6
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:47,000
From Earth he seems to slow down. But his clock keeps advancing normally.

7
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:58,000
Gravity pulls harder on his feet than his head. He stretches like spaghetti.

8
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:09,000
Finally he approaches the singularity, where our theories stop describing what happens.

9
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:20,000
No speech, no helicopter, no rescue. Once the horizon is crossed, no way back.

10
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:30,000
Who would you accidentally send to space? Let me know in the comments.
